        "flagIsRound": "initProtocol",
        "naiveSound": "initProtocol",
        "noInfer": "initInfer",
        "unelectedEntry": "initMislabel"
      },
      "source": [
        "lib/setup.c:barrier_sync_op",
        "lib/setup.c:___sync_op_struct",
        "lib/setup.c:SYNC_GET_MSG",
        "lib/setup.c:SYNC_SEND_MSG"
      ],
      "papers": [],
      "scope": "Defined-access completed-operation record. The caller's proposal can win, so the elected op may equal the entry op. COMPLETED_PAST requires election, the elected op, the VM round, and tag 1. Publishing the entry op before election is the negative control. ABSENT is not idleness. The flag is not the round. A torn read and a SAME_CYCLE inference are negative controls. Cohort overwrite beyond this finite election, argument words, seq wrap, fault preservation, and native admission are outside this check."
    }
  ]
